{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1276,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a74ae67ad6b8d25e498f734f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿面包的时候面包机坏了…\n我貌似就稍微碰了一下…\n…警戒等级设定提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8abe90095c2cf28a2aa9c31b1b76aa5cd891448eae30aa9b3c50c7351c80006",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8ffca59f5c41aae86c1c77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "西野花同学的便当营养、份量、\n美味程度，全都很完美。\n感知到『幸福度』上升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1afe8c9a752d8d9b8878aaf26299f6131e90941abf867af0f80c5fb76593cab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92db7acd077a26f9dff612a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…『欢迎回来，主人』\n因为飞鹰同学说像女仆服，\n所以正在实践。感觉怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "25128494cc104401a0754fa35205b793441edf52e9c4129696452044c7ef0e49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a19bb73df95a42e25b43c89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要在点心完成后配上樱花，\n就能提高『华丽感』。\n由此认识到了『春日之趣』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b03859a937e0c0b075cdee2b20177c7c39a2db24c3318b03758e3c60955cc2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff179a4c1d1b0deb037d460",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天有很多应季水果，\n每种都营养丰富。选择起来非常\n困难。正在研究其优先顺序…",
      "source_fingerprint": "499af3dfb311d7bb965c17b4bca06634cc4d7dbbcc180e26762b696f757e5e12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce58d5c96502ad42d1293ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在宿舍厨房帮忙\n削红薯皮的时候得到了『称赞』。\n…简单的工作的话我就会很擅长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a44d0ae336eae4dbc2cdaef06f9f6561e07a690c448a2925a2f14b2eb3df1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91afd6a7cdcac400abf1735f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节和情人节。\n每个都需要点心。判断为发挥\n经验的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f525759e98971d24bddd89b8df3225685edff288c5edf2e73d6bf1483a156e70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03fb184cb4bb5d1c00ea3ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "申请制服的时候，\n我也问了米浴的想法。\n她的想法充满了『可爱』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1866eac3495da7feaee8ad65e308178f5e7e70c5974ba56ffe976340957a0c80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272e4bceecff6ffe8968fb0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我印象中的情人节是传达\n『思念』的日子。但『思念』\n是什么…解释起来有些困难。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1022368b1ef2bcdf1a624501fbb115b1becd7b9cf59c64f7782a0309e61c020d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d9d81831d2a5387be2b03b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管多严格的任务我都\n一定能完成。\n请下指令吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99098cebdc08cc46cfbbb24ab0bbb0ac8be947c3301f6eab984d78b2d2b622d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:757593dd7524a59ee56bd12f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "準備完了",
      "source_fingerprint": "d888e7c7a8303af0f59b50de130b2e2b2913233456b35e146d05949af7d68885",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b7670cafb8675aab6acb887",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『努力可以弥补耐力』\n我要实践父亲的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a873c6956a7021bab30900f2392c440f90ab71f67252729026a9f3c8a6b5a47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f7100b1fdcee0ca20b7bae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放松是没有必要的。\n我希望有比普通训练\n强度更高的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9d90e9bfc24201edd18661c81898c53d58ada8522f4778edf4240124d6d77d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22412c5dc9681c428fb17e2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了取胜。\n――美浦波旁，启动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfd767b83260d688db42eed0a8a44d13c9519dc6941bd01bccd4a8d4ce4bf7b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b523296e93ec791b24859d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有什么烦恼吗？\n请不要在意我，\n按主人所希望的来就行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "febbcdbc89a2565ffb3b6e84584b30fbafddd741acc12dba56fb9bcb3a7ce2c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caf0e2b24b23a9c78df46188",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请尽管来，主人。\n不管什么困难，我应该都能\n以努力克服的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9aa7ddcc62085d7532bb91fe4dc01801c31bb56b799d4f3ed58e200cee5e367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65490e27f1d73b9017c51eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会放弃自己。\n我相信如果是主人的话，\n一定能将我带到任何地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2853f5a77765f6f6d80f7fabb16f0145b8ed7e0d7f466b7af42626e37735d5b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab1c8c3d2520abf3688f3d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已启动。\n目前，待机中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cae7605ac0d5a8c0968d2a0d66deab5fe849ad57e8052e6234afeed4a9a7cd12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38f186cca4c9c6597e74dfe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提升状态需要试错。\n今天也开始试错吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbb5bacef0b22c2e2d26292010f88c54eb4c16fb218b8496915776e87d73e39b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57bef381172073f39d3b9670",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『顿悟』是积累了训练\n之后才会出现的东西。\n努力才是最重要的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c48af6653d4e731f7878c53af5a1648e5cc0527551aa3e1ebf8befadb37fb4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da720eac448924f14179defd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了补充营养，\n我带来了点心。\n如果需要甜味的话，请告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11ee73b96593fb4aa7dcff0ddba4458b777e7f6ebf698281afe855a07301c7e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc7be685651fb8230a700404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1小时后的状态…\n预测会有点『饿』。设定休息时\n进行糖分摄入。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f21d4f0cfaae7869b81fce13fbd149771076f55899aacd2c7fa34a154c3c864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:769de2bdadd4883488b8605c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不需要担心装饰品的问题。\n这些全都经过了维护\n和增强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5014f0000ca97eee01fcb74962a9270ec6a05866b463c6ee77a8df6027a1e896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3e014a3daafff0adeecbebd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因有对大家的『情感』\n我才不会偷懒。\n期待一场认真的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59ef1e1cd71be7d6669626b3adc00f6cf25ed037078a0b16028ca1e5c9225092",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1388b9d6af9f17f285356ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您想要『闲聊』吗？\n…设定计时器。计时结束之前\n我们来进行『闲聊』吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d8fa7ead097804f19063c4018e1a0b48e5fd15075a294c160a792b65d907cb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:973bd6809aea48d1c8ed29e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本次的记录数据，\n是与主人的无可替代的『记忆』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25c0bf459cfbe491e5948362da9c5fc364a1e9d42cab3b57757ac638caa9c4a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d454ad4b9ee472ec958a4ea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已确认达成目标…感谢主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9a4321e2fa941bde4586988aa2d24d8852db6b1511cdd31a8cdd801b7731d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff56d0ceeb4dbfc3f7ef274d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "通过追求糖度感知到『成长』。\n无与伦比的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d2af00662f6792d397a76e2f8c3056f8f18538e81722cee5ecefac9122a9de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47955456ec83abe1f8aa4989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将这段『不甜』的旅程，记录下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56b560e90d940ac0680f9c7e45c0edd1ad030fa8b4e4bb7d57d9410c8fc64b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa138793c94e67a483a4bae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "升级已完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfede7a097991f2e1ec3e7e24fae27bf8837fc7c1429487e9a28e4e9b9d6b338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c13ca5fa3af421936a523b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁，已升级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f532b90280c5ce07af2c2b6aa049937cf159804db0e4b2db464257cf8428773",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be8751df9fe3e7dd291829d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到，我是美浦波旁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1b370d74a03861456e5ee978e6673a7ca3b387a88be4fa95c3fa3dd6519401",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6a4742ac404e780645b1ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请下达初次任务的命令。\n我将遵从你…主人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f461f25159ad24af51f42b89da35b37e8b8a9c3ec3ee94969e0622161f0dc64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c5157e032d455e7a56a7f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援功能，提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caf1b3a78b3074f051be1c66136c0e67323ce079c26d015565bfce54d5900f48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe93afc4500cf73301ec5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认支援功能输出提高。",
      "source_fingerprint": "753c7249f7b0654f218c23a542556caa63f17c8108f7d2cc92e4cda933d4112b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ac4401708270c54b1e671ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设定糖度上升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1285d29cc012fb144067782dd2d22e4a0630f2fdcffe87b5a8dc99b5b38210d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0c90c2047b369c0ae6c79a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已增大火候的\n上限。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29797c1379ee658fa9b11a35c95efdcdcdf83f2ffb9c4cf4628fa04a9bb669b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99968e4c1bef0ce8e49a51a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将会是一段『不甜』的旅程――\n即便如此也无妨的话，请您同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334b06cf98fcafa8d4b696ebd9511f0c668c30666e10d16448e3dca9481818cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec41bc2636ac5ab07b91c6c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是美浦波旁。\n如果需要甜味的话，请告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f11cc2a1a3475ab19fc1312c12415d513af73a393b26eb305ca730de18d6d8c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1026",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5053485eb9e23cde4e8fddb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前去取胜吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29dc95012dd6b46b651d819cb7a946b04dd5ada1a160ac35b52d11b7d681c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f71f174bfc24b5febc841f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会来特雷森学园的原因……\r\n那其实是非常简单的事情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6855689db47e4fef80e6726eb0fc76b77bf92b09781961344c5c22b3067dcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a617fa9fc4726a4cc74fce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08dc8ecf93538697f0320849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c728c9afbf2201d88612f301",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凭我自己，\r\n绝对没办法发现的自己的魅力……\r\n今后你也能继续陪我、帮助我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f5849203f8b14bd544ad0ca936fbde05580146cb88bbbcd06dcc88260a71241",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac41f0f30039e3b1781e04e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对可爱的衣服是有兴趣的……！\r\n所以等我适合穿的时候再来买吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "476c5bf9f2edc99a042f8a4eb0d46320c2264ddd2cfc1e92e8b2576046a9e0ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd18d30e9fccce388d5ad692",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n要不要去新年参拜兼跑石阶，\r\n来个新年第一场运动？",
      "source_fingerprint": "67e6b0652a278a7aaf70c3c53af062679b36461ad2def364b09ed9234d21e655",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf316141f4b3a88fdb925815",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节我比较常是收礼的那方。\r\n那会让我感受到大家对我的支持，\r\n所以我很开心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7208b1b2a8cbce1cc6fa00d606a1923fe9311c43020aa5ff3768b282fc61c394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37c3dd4b1f0041d4fe3deeaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「你喜欢吃甜食吧？多出了一个就\r\n给你吧」……刚、刚才说的不算数！\r\n太令人害羞了……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "189c30a75a85181bc68ed2484c608c2a7304163603a7dc309cd08a94479a783e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a1833cc55bf85fb1d1f128c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一年只能见一次喜欢的人啊……\r\n见到的时候一定会心跳很快吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "757b8bf5f4176ba1a95ebfaf5f675cd136a80fc3b36f5ad2aed72c479b8187b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:776361acc9bd48bc2b61f0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔唔～！！\r\n我才在想飞鹰子会做什么恶作剧，\r\n没想到竟然是化妆～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a787e4d2651c3b4ca241f24a5ce24c01323874fd9161c474abf20a934746041a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1939ec0553f605fe69c52985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到圣诞节，目白家的成员会\r\n聚在一起交换礼物。\r\n不知道我的重训套组会是谁收到呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "58041d3506d7f2e8fa399c78ad18951afa765a9912e9b8dd1e94a778dd2726a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b6bbcb2d328e38c1839f39c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，你会有兴趣想看灯海吗……？\r\n啊，没有啦，我只是问问看而已，\r\n没什么特别意思……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2507363116ba79204e01a9c2fda37c59c55d26ec8c50add9dc9ad57aab7ae4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f7e5fba92ad3bf47784f61e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a3ced789c61733c15824d2a1d8800362042ada79c6cd6d4a48b2f1a61f1be68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fcbcf2b84692a05b2626109",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托训练员的福，\r\n今年也培育出了很棒的肌肉呢！\r\n明年也要照这样子继续麻烦你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57dc2135b76558a6ff3df3dbea2d8678ac8cdf60de7652dcf2ed84922bec9393",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0d0bebcc1530efa332a323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请收下生日蛋糕！\r\n吃完之后，我们一起去跑步\r\n消耗热量吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "492b218f4ae0e114f4938e4999dafd44b17a0ea4acc858f9d167cb3d123aa782",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60f56b050a67f4c6cb3f5638",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我思考自己能送给你的\r\n最棒礼物是什么……最后决定\r\n送你我严选的重训排程表，请收下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7fcd0fd1b0ba4b4535fb96769a38d6d75382a104bb3f827a2b45e187f7a2d08",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6ea515a84411d3d171f0fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "麦昆的生日跟我的生日很接近。\r\n每年都连着庆祝，真的好开心喔！\r\n耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1ffb2bd3654d8a81ca0d7c5d499d4fa1bf3f68c8bad22befb9674b38c42f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8518b9a730801d927903a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你要帮我庆生啊……！？\r\n哇～早知道是这样的话，\r\n就事先想好想做的事情了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b440e2bdb8fabfb5b21334424f8a5f07cc27697b7c0f4a07fdd77d0340579943",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb2cf2fe0a9c48a82b8e6ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的公告哦！\r\n我们用跑的去看，\r\n顺便当作是训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6686155680760f55fa508af377232433326831abd1f9d7393382810a1c07f678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29a9bcfa964b35265e22a14e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像是收到礼物了。\r\n会是哑铃吗？还是杠铃？\r\n难道是仰卧推举套组……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2c45e07fdef2185030faad288b0f38a66236e8667187f88b683c4525dda23c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5659c7343451fa7f98ea0d38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了呢！\r\n耶嘿嘿，我也不能输给你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac1597013ca7b8bb24b3436779fff33e2ac45a043cbb816431cea4a75cd08d45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a06d654d79f85153d3c6b2e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要有活动了。\r\n为了到时候能够尽情享受活动，\r\n要趁现在把自己锻炼好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18c2894956ab7a78f17f6af038033a6da1ad9be5d530ce3390487fc5939ca814",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2329baa3eae89e3c7302aa0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了耶！\r\n要不要过去看看呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "476a393cc6a132e8bc900ca579ebfd0f221b33008e240159d6443403b306a7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:badd4a0c4ab320cd65525790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a425726bf8c03f9fa8083e4ab755645a94ead72cceb48ea80381941f2e7b339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa1e541df227519d853133b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢，赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d8a8a416fc9667e93d16c24ce932dd1328cf8348b7f1d7937b6628d97fbc85f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad65fc1f6f4e14d2b5f33759",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服最讲究，或者说最让我\r\n伤透脑筋的地方……应该是颜色吧？\r\n我试着设计成带点成熟的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb44a225bbe977bc7de915325798422bbc4b57b6a7b01eff2b2720b85b965d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a96ce02c3544609959ddbd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对项链和手环特别有感情呢。\r\n我心想，只买这两种饰品的话……\r\n应该没问题吧？便谨慎地挑选了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe41ddd25be40c963303999ae94f49b6fd8f95992a563c6abeb9af9a27297fc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ee51b1f9d5048ca98ff41f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信推荐我买了适合\r\n这套衣服的香水……不过对我来说\r\n可能有点太早了！嗯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3d1c17dfc64525071c041fb56424f167d13d08003e2723da689035fb55645d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc114aee07b48e062e9f67b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是一场很精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74b16e0b5bf1c112915fa0c9346cf8e6640db2b8adb0c74a0f32782c20dafeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73928712df416081c0c6e0d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们团结拿下的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ffc77542cc2fb2029cd1fa121c6657d32a26dc48238717255d67bcdd9e9e99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d5f7c8a4d9fc5396622c897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真可惜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a425726bf8c03f9fa8083e4ab755645a94ead72cceb48ea80381941f2e7b339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5656c71484b37bf242258c9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是一场很精彩的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74b16e0b5bf1c112915fa0c9346cf8e6640db2b8adb0c74a0f32782c20dafeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9ec686dcd9da6525afeb6b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了！更新了高分纪录！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b1db4cf653f31c957425e0d257a59098070f0bf4730bc97194264da7226d5b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb4c8010192409f24845eae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "各位，我们全力以赴吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d83efa9aee0b6bc3aa6709d08370c1925cb731fd7d52326a7379965305c74e75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e406489143ef6f6a0ed772e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アイネス、気合い入れてくよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a20c8e6ea1faff2e7b0c120b820bc086b1b3dc2a0525282f06f9f038aab30236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c94b5241359d0e5f55c2bcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有想起从前？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a1743b99f6b8d4888228cac9b128c8e5fbe653e7fc2600d7ca0d4af78c81a20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc19ed3a536302b4bcf943ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、よろよろー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8cbca88c2af11986c693aa26ef55121c2979ad53fc9fb87b889c6d6a130c519",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f498f01f09aeecdaeb0f584b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a176ed1537ecc39a767df157",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是训练还是重训，都交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "57660bd10f888885af47e3f07b5ca6da5e1f237d1c62c4efc28837e71f478308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3eddda9f7329b52745c291",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉得到历史的痕迹呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae4edbc9a337002decb8b077e6c8ae8e0d3404630d1ab387b4992d06c600d3ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1027",
        "110001"
      ]
    }
  ]
